        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM566, Traditional Customizable Pull with Rosettes </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTimeless, decorative, and enduring, these Classic pulls feature 3 finial options, variable lengths, 3 grip styles, and 5 finishes with a coordinating decorative base plate—custom elements that enrich and elevate traditional design.  Rockwood's Classic Fluted Pulls can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rockwood Classic Urn Tip Reeded Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass </li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Brass</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b> RM566-10:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM566-20:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b> RM566-30:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<b>Note</b>: This offset pull is handcrafted in the USA specifically for your order, offering customization options such as alternate lengths to suit your exact door requirements. Due to its made-to-order nature, this item is <b>non-cancelable and non-returnable</b>. For assistance or custom requests, </b> please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> prior to ordering.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Customizable Pull with Rosettes",
                "description": "Classic Fluted Urn Tip Pull, Rockwood RM566.  Timeless, decorative, and enduring, these Classic fluted grip pulls feature finials, variable lengths, and a coordinating decorative base plate—custom elements that enrich and elevate traditional design.  Rockwood's Classic Fluted Pulls can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.  Choose from 3 grip styles, 3 finial styles, 3 sizes, and 5 beautiful finish options.",
                "keywords": "Rockwood Classic Pull, ROC-RM566, Fluted Handles, Rope Pulls, Spiral Handles, Reeded Pulls, Smooth Grip Pulls, Smooth Traditional Handles, Urn Tip Brass Pull, Berry Tip Brass Bull, Pinecone Tip Brass Pull, Acorn Tip Brass Pull, 10\" Classic Pull, 20\", Classic Pulls, 30\" Classic Pulls, 10\" Traditional Pulls, 20\" Traditional Pulls, 30\" Traditional Pulls, Traditional Refrigerator Pulls, Traditional Appliance Pulls"
